---
title: Roster Listing with ETag Cache
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as WordPress Plugin
    participant API as FastAPI /roster
    participant Service as RosterService

    Client->>API: GET /api/v0/roster (If-None-Match: "abc123")
    API->>Service: get_entries(model)
    Service-->>API: entries[]
    API->>API: compute ETag(entries)
    alt ETag unchanged
        API-->>Client: 304 Not Modified (ETag: "abc123")
    else New roster content
        API-->>Client: 200 OK payload (ETag: "def456")
    end
